### ReadingProgress
### Create a reading progress entry
POST localhost:5027/api/reading-progress
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "bookId": 1,
  "progress": 10,
  "LastChapterRead": "1",
  "Status" : 1
}

### Get the entry
GET localhost:5027/api/reading-progress/2

### Update its progress
PUT localhost:5027/api/reading-progress/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "progress": 50,
  "LastChapterRead": "5",
  "Status": 0
}

### Delete it
DELETE localhost:5027/api/reading-progress/1

### Books

### Create book
POST localhost:5027/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ExternalId": "OL19283920",
  "Isbn10": "9780575068568",
  "Title": "Dune",
  "Author": "Frank Herbert"
}

### Delete book
DELETE localhost:5027/api/books/2

### Get book
GET localhost:5027/api/books/1


### Create reading log entry
POST localhost:5027/api/reading-log
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "UserId": 1,
    "BookId": 18,
    "StartPage": 11,
    "EndPage": 100,
    "Date": "2026-10-25"
}

### Get reading log entry
GET localhost:5027/api/reading-log/2

### Delete reading log entry
DELETE localhost:5027/api/reading-log/1

### Get reading log summary
GET localhost:5027/api/reading-log/summary/1?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
